  << /ActualText (Each node updates according to the weights of its edges\056\n\n\n\n\nwhich\054 in simpler words is just \n\nnew\137node \075 f\050\034sum of similar neighbors\035\054 \034sum of dissimilar neighbors\035\051\n\nNormalising the edges \050so that they are squished between 0 and 1\051\054\n\n\n\n\n\nWe have our node update rule\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
