  << /ActualText (Each edge updates according to the weights of its nodes\054\n\n\n\n\nwhere fe\050vi\054 vj\051 \075 similarity between nodes\054 \n\nthe first equation describing increasing probability that they are in the same class if they\031re similar\n\nthe second equation describing increasing different class probability if they are dissimilar\056\n\nNodes update according to edges\054 edges update according to nodes\056\nCo\055evolution\056\n\nRunning a query on softmax attention \050SMAT\051\054 each node votes for the input node \050similar to me\054 dissimilar to me\051\054 and the importance of the vote \050weight\051 is decided by the edge strength\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
